.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "2024" "libmyutils" "User Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy a fixed number of characters from a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.B int mystrncpy(char *dest, const char *src, int n);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrncpy()
function copies at most
.I n
characters from the string pointed to by
.IR src
into the buffer pointed to by
.IR dest .
A null terminator is always appended.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters copied.
